#: enhancedROC/options/validationMethod.description
msgid ""
"Bootstrap: Harrell's optimism-corrected AUC of a logistic model of the "
"marker (resamples holding one outcome group are dropped and counted). "
"Cross-validation: stratified 10-fold, or one fold per patient of the smaller "
"outcome group when it has fewer than 10, reporting the mean fold AUC and the "
"SD across folds, which is not a standard error."
