#: R/psychopdaROC.b.R
msgid ""
"DeLong's test uses the validated pROC package implementation. Reference: "
"DeLong ER, DeLong DM, Clarke-Pearson DL (1988). Comparing the areas under "
"two or more correlated ROC curves: a nonparametric approach. Biometrics "
"44(3):837-845."
msgstr ""
"DeLong testi, pROC paketinin doğrulanmış uygulamasını kullanır. Kaynak: "
"DeLong ER, DeLong DM, Clarke-Pearson DL (1988). Comparing the areas under "
"two or more correlated ROC curves: a nonparametric approach. Biometrics "
"44(3):837-845."

#: R/psychopdaROC.b.R
msgid ""
"DeLong's test was computed by this module's own fallback implementation, not "
"by pROC, because the pROC path failed; see the warning above. Reference: "
"DeLong ER, DeLong DM, Clarke-Pearson DL (1988). Comparing the areas under "
"two or more correlated ROC curves: a nonparametric approach. Biometrics "
"44(3):837-845."
msgstr ""
"pROC yolu başarısız olduğundan DeLong testi pROC tarafından değil, bu "
"modülün kendi yedek uygulamasıyla hesaplandı; yukarıdaki uyarıya bakın. "
"Kaynak: DeLong ER, DeLong DM, Clarke-Pearson DL (1988). Comparing the areas "
"under two or more correlated ROC curves: a nonparametric approach. "
"Biometrics 44(3):837-845."

