#: enhancedROC/options/youdenOptimization.description
msgid ""
"Find the optimal cutoff by maximizing the Youden index (sensitivity + "
"specificity - 1), subject to the minimum sensitivity/specificity below. When "
"off, the cutoff closest to the top-left corner of the ROC curve is reported "
"instead. The minimum sensitivity and specificity are used only by the Youden "
"search; with this off they are not applied and a warning says so."
msgstr ""
"Optimal kesme noktasını, aşağıdaki minimum duyarlılık/özgüllük koşuluna "
"bağlı olarak Youden indeksini (duyarlılık + özgüllük - 1) en üst düzeye "
"çıkararak bulur. Kapalı olduğunda bunun yerine ROC eğrisinin sol üst "
"köşesine en yakın kesme noktası raporlanır. Minimum duyarlılık ve özgüllük "
"yalnızca Youden aramasında kullanılır; bu seçenek kapalıyken uygulanmazlar "
"ve bir uyarı bunu belirtir."

#: R/agreement.b.R
msgid ""
"Finn (1970) proposed no interpretive bands for this coefficient himself. The "
"0.40, 0.60 and 0.75 cut-points follow the Cicchetti (1994) reliability "
"convention, which was written for the ICC and for kappa rather than for "
"Finn's coefficient; the split at 0.90 into Excellent and Outstanding is this "
"module's own. They are not the Landis {tag1} Koch (1977) kappa bands or the "
"Koo {tag2} Li (2016) ICC bands used elsewhere in this analysis, so the same "
"number is described differently there."
msgstr ""

