#: R/decisioncalculator.b.R
msgid ""
"Projected fractional counts assume sensitivity and specificity transport to "
"the target population. These are flagged observations, not measured extra "
"review time or unique patients. The projections use the point estimates of "
"sensitivity and specificity and assume no uncertainty in them or in the "
"target prevalence."
