#: decisioncombine/options/goldPositive.description.ui
msgid ""
"Select the level indicating disease presence (e.g., \"1\", \"positive\", "
"\"malignant\"). It must be chosen: it is never taken from the order of the "
"levels, and until it is chosen the analysis lists the levels found and "
