msgid ""
"Weights for ordinal categories follow the {tag1}Weighted Kappa{tag2} option\n"
"                    (unweighted / linear / squared). Confidence intervals "
"use the non-null\n"
"                    asymptotic standard error from {tag3}vcd::Kappa{tag4}, "
